{"id":"c6642949679a7c44","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-re-closure.md","title":"c.e. 集合的闭包性质","display":"thm-re-closure — c.e. 集合的闭包性质","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-re-closure","aliases":["20-thm-re-closure"],"display":"thm-re-closure — c.e. 集合的闭包性质","chapter":"2","section":"2.1.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.1.11；Corollary 2.1.6；Exercise 2.1.18 的全函数特例","source_pdf_pages":[60,62,63],"source_printed_pages":[24,26,27],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-re-proj]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-re-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-re-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-re-closure — c.e. 集合的闭包性质"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.1.11；Corollary 2.1.6；Exercise 2.1.18 的全函数特例"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>60</span><span>62</span><span>63</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>24</span><span>26</span><span>27</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"17d2f06d43a19f1e\" href=\"?note=17d2f06d43a19f1e\" title=\"20-thm-re-proj\">20-thm-re-proj</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=W_e,B=W_j\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(A=W_e,B=W_j\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 为固定有限阶段枚举。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"17d2f06d43a19f1e\" href=\"?note=17d2f06d43a19f1e\" title=\"20-thm-re-proj\">20-thm-re-proj</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}re\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\cup B,A\\cap B,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:x\\in A\\land y\\in B\\},f[A],f^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e,j\\\n[W_{u(e,j)}=W_e\\cup W_j\\land W_{v(e,j)}=W_e\\cap W_j].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}re\\text{-}closure}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nA\\cup B,A\\cap B,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle:x\\in A\\land y\\in B\\},f[A],f^{-1}[A]\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall e,j\\\n[W_{u(e,j)}=W_e\\cup W_j\\land W_{v(e,j)}=W_e\\cap W_j].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>并集的域程序在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 上寻找 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_{e,s}\\cup W_{j,s}\">\\(x\\in W_{e,s}\\cup W_{j,s}\\)</span>；交集程序寻找 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in W_{e,s}\\cap W_{j,s}\">\\(x\\in W_{e,s}\\cap W_{j,s}\\)</span>。因为阶段单调，后一条件最终成立恰当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 进入两边，即使入集阶段不同。矩阵可判定，s-m-n 给断言中的全编译器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(e,j),v(e,j)\">\\(u(e,j),v(e,j)\\)</span>；把此前漏列的参数定理补为直接依赖。</p>\n<p>配对乘积对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span> 同时等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\">\\(x\\in A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in B\">\\(y\\in B\\)</span>；总共只有有限两个停止见证，交错等待可半判定。图像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[A]\">\\(f[A]\\)</span> 逐阶段对已出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span> 模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(a)\">\\(f(a)\\)</span> 并输出结果；给待判定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 则交错所有候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>，等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(a)=z\">\\(f(a)=z\\)</span>。逆像程序先计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span> 再等待它入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；全定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 保证这个初始计算总可完成。各程序统一编译，集合均 c.e.。</p>\n<p>亦可用 c.e. 关系投影直接归纳；对部分可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的图像及逆像，本书 Exercise 2.1.18 的已有原子给更强版本。这里的补集横线不属于闭包运算，故未从并交闭包推出 c.e. 集合族为布尔代数。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 24、26–27 / PDF 60、62–63。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-re-proj","status":"resolved","id":"17d2f06d43a19f1e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-re-proj]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status